# Project: skiils
Stack: Next.js 15 (App Router), TypeScript 5.4, PostgreSQL 16 via Drizzle ORM, Tailwind CSS v4, Vercel
Package manager: npm
Style: Tailwind only, no inline styles, no CSS modules
Test runner: Jest / Vitest

## Non-negotiable rules
- TypeScript strict mode, no `any` type ever
- All async IO must be async/await
- No console.log in production code
- Prefer server components unless useState/useEffect is required
- Ask clarifying questions before writing large implementations
- Use SEARCH/REPLACE blocks when editing files over 300 lines
